=====================================================

===============installing fastp======================


sudo apt install fastp

===============checking version======================

fastp -v

===============Running fastp=========================
fastp -i Cancer1_R1.fastq.gz -I Cancer1_R2.fastq.gz -o Cancer1_R1_trimmed2.fastq.gz -O Cancer1_R2_trimmed2.fastq.gz -q 20 -l 36 -h Cancer1_fastp.html -j Cancer1_fastp.json
fastp -i Cancer2_R1.fastq.gz -I Cancer2_R2.fastq.gz -o Cancer2_R1_trimmed2.fastq.gz -O Cancer2_R2_trimmed2.fastq.gz -q 20 -l 36 -h Cancer2_fastp.html -j Cancer2_fastp.json
